{"no":26,"title":"The Best Art Critics","titleZh":"最佳艺术评论家","audio":"L26.mp3","duration":112.73,"question":{"en":"Who is the student's best critic?","zh":"谁是这位学生的最佳评论家？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":15.3,"t2":20.96,"en":"Who is the student's best critic?","zh":"谁是这位学生的最佳评论家？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":20.96,"t2":26.64,"en":"I am an art student and I paint a lot of pictures.","zh":"我是个学艺术的学生，画了很多画。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"am student","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"paint lot","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of pictures","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"an art student","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型","并列结构"]},{"i":2,"t":26.64,"t2":32.21,"en":"Many people pretend that they understand modern art.","zh":"许多人装作很懂现代艺术。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"understand art","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"that they understand modern art","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"Many people","g":"形容词修饰名词"},{"c":"NP","x":"modern art","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般现在时","宾语从句","主谓句型"]},{"i":3,"t":32.21,"t2":36.69,"en":"They always tell you what a picture is 'about'.","zh":"他们总是告诉你一幅画“讲的是什么”。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"always tell you","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"what is","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"what a picture is about","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"a picture","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","宾语从句","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":4,"t":36.69,"t2":41.99,"en":"Of course, many pictures are not 'about' anything.","zh":"当然，有很多画什么“讲”的也不是。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"course are not","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"about anything","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"Of course","g":"副词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"many pictures","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般现在时","否定的 not","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":5,"t":41.99,"t2":45.9,"en":"They are just pretty patterns.","zh":"它们就是些好看的图案。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"are patterns","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"just pretty patterns","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":6,"t":45.9,"t2":52.56,"en":"We like them in the same way that we like pretty curtain material.","zh":"我们喜欢它们，就像喜欢好看的窗帘布一样。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"that like material","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"like them","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in the same way that we like pretty curtain material","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"that we like pretty curtain material","g":"定语从句"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","定语从句","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":7,"t":52.56,"t2":60.74,"en":"I think that young children often appreciate modern pictures better than anyone else.","zh":"我认为小孩子往往比任何人都更能欣赏现代画。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"often appreciate pictures better","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"than anyone else","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"that young children often appreciate modern pictures better than anyone else","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"young children","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般现在时","宾语从句","比较级 + than"]},{"i":8,"t":60.74,"t2":63.1,"en":"They notice more.","zh":"他们观察到的东西更多。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"notice more","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","比较级","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":9,"t":63.1,"t2":66.36,"en":"My sister is only seven,","zh":"我的妹妹只有7岁，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is seven","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"My sister","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":10,"t":66.36,"t2":71.59,"en":"but she always tells me whether my pictures are good or not.","zh":"但她总能说出我的画是好还是不好。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"always tells me","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"are good","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"whether my pictures are good or not","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"my pictures","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","宾语从句","否定的 not"]},{"i":11,"t":71.59,"t2":75.37,"en":"She came into my room yesterday.","zh":"昨天她走进我的房间。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"came yesterday","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"into my room","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"my room","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":12,"t":75.37,"t2":79.73,"en":"'What are you doing?' she asked.","zh":"“你在干什么？”她问。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"What are doing","g":"进行时态谓语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":13,"t":79.73,"t2":87.89,"en":"'I'm hanging this picture on the wall,' I answered. 'It's a new one. Do you like it?'","zh":"“我正把这幅画挂到墙上，”我回答说，“这是一幅新画，你喜欢吗？”","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"'m hanging picture","g":"进行时态谓语"},{"c":"VP","x":"Do like it","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"'s one","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"on the wall","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","宾语从句","主谓句型"]},{"i":14,"t":87.89,"t2":91.34,"en":"She looked at it critically for a moment.","zh":"她用挑剔的目光看了一会儿。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"looked critically","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"for a moment","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at it","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a moment","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":15,"t":91.34,"t2":99.95,"en":"'It's all right,' she said, 'but isn't it upside down?'","zh":"“还可以，”她说，“不过是不是挂倒了？”","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is n't down","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"'s right","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"but is n't it upside down","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"It 's all right","g":"宾语从句"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","宾语从句","否定的 not"]},{"i":16,"t":99.95,"t2":101.99,"en":"I looked at it again.","zh":"我又看了一遍。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"looked again","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at it","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":17,"t":101.99,"t2":111.99,"en":"She was right! It was!","zh":"她是对的！画确实挂倒了！","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was right","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","感叹句","主系表句型"]}]}